physicalRef: network_usage/database
description: "Telecom revenue assurance Link Analysis showcase - One row per subscriber per month, summed from the switch's call and data records: the period (the first of the month), voice minutes and data MB. One file per month (NETWORK_USAGE_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the network_usage Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: period
columns[4]{name,type,classification}:
  msisdn,string,
  period,date,
  minutes,number,
  mb,number,
